386:  `.cr-pool-value`'s display font (`var(--fh)`, Cinzel) — this app's own type rule reserves that
387:  face for numerals only. Verified visually against the REAL shipped `theme.css`/`components.css`/
388:  `suite.css` (not a mockup's own duplicate styles) with a Playwright screenshot in both themes,
389:  matching crd-3b's own established verification method exactly; the ephemeral harness file and
390:  screenshots were deleted after use, per that same precedent.
