400:  selection call, and the gate-closes-mid-flow discard. New suite totals: crd-4a 19/19,
401:  crd-3b (extended) 32/32. Full changed-area regression (crd-1/crd-2/crd-3a/crd-3b/crd-4a/
402:  api-tracker-state/oaq-2/oaq-3/otc-2-office-actions/otc-2-city-status-calc): 249/249, 0 failed.
